From c2893acbbfe188ec923614191989dce21ff0cf8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 06:41:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 404/638] [AROS] Trace child commit request scheduling

AI_PHASE: chromium-process-model
AI_STATUS: diagnostic
AI_OBSERVED: Runtime47 gives the child a valid surface, viewport, and connected sink but never reaches begin-main-frame send.
AI_FIX_REASON: Distinguish commit-request deduplication, impl task delivery, and legitimate scheduler blocking before changing behavior.
AI_SCOPE: bounded per-instance AROS-only telemetry in ProxyMain, ProxyImpl, Scheduler, and SchedulerStateMachine.
AI_VALIDATION: exact-file diff check passed; no non-AROS scheduling semantics changed.
---
